# Intent-Aware Layout Generation Project Structure

This is a research project for intent-aware layout generation using diffusion models and spatial guidance.

## Core Architecture
- **Main Code**: [code/](mdc:code/) - Core implementation
- **Demo Interface**: [demo/app.py](mdc:demo/app.py) - Gradio web interface
- **Intent Detection**: [intent_detect/](mdc:intent_detect/) - Design intent detection models
- **Data Processing**: [code/data_process/](mdc:code/data_process/) - Data preprocessing and saliency detection
- **Models**: [code/cgbdm/](mdc:code/cgbdm/) - Core diffusion and transformer models

## Key Components
- **Diffusion Model**: [code/cgbdm/diffusion.py](mdc:code/cgbdm/diffusion.py) - Main diffusion implementation
- **Layout Model**: [code/cgbdm/layout_model.py](mdc:code/cgbdm/layout_model.py) - Layout generation model
- **Training**: [code/scripts/train.py](mdc:code/scripts/train.py) - Training script
- **Testing**: [code/scripts/test.py](mdc:code/scripts/test.py) - Testing script
- **Configs**: [code/configs/](mdc:code/configs/) - YAML configuration files

## Datasets
- **CGL Dataset**: [data/dataset/cgl/](mdc:data/dataset/cgl/) - CGL dataset splits
- **PKU Dataset**: [data/dataset/pku/](mdc:data/dataset/pku/) - PKU dataset splits
- **Model Weights**: [data/model_weights/](mdc:data/model_weights/) - Pre-trained model weights

## Experiments
- **Results**: [experiments/](mdc:experiments/) - Training and evaluation results
- **Checkpoints**: [data/checkpoints/](mdc:data/checkpoints/) - Model checkpoints